; std/geometry: one hub reaching every spoke.
;
; Five calls: the hub once, each of the three spokes once, and the mediation.
; Six would mean the hub was re-read per spoke — it is bound before them, which
; is what makes it a hub rather than three separate readings, and the count is
; the only thing that can prove it.
; expect: calls 5
; expect: clean
; expect: answers
((# std/geometry)
 (std-radial
   "Reply with the three assessments, separated by ' | ', nothing else."
   "Answer with exactly: the payment queue stalled"
   "Assess the blast radius of this in five words."
   "Assess the detection of this in five words."
   "Assess the rollback of this in five words."))
